    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A row of <var>n</var> bulbs is initially off (<const>0</const>).<br>Each of the <var>k</var> operations flips every bulb in an inclusive range of positions, from <var>l</var> to <var>r</var>: an off bulb turns on and an on bulb turns off.<br>Positions are 1-based, and operations are applied in the order given.<br>Print the final state of every bulb, from position 1 to position <var>n</var>, as space-separated <const>0</const> and <const>1</const> values.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>n</var> and <var>k</var>.<br><strong>Next K lines:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>l</var> and <var>r</var>, the inclusive range to flip.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The <var>n</var> final bulb states, space-separated.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &lt;= <var>n</var> &lt;= 20<br>1 &lt;= <var>k</var> &lt;= 20<br>1 &lt;= <var>l</var> &lt;= <var>r</var> &lt;= <var>n</var></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">1 1\n1 1</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
